# Build context for any container image built from the repository root.
#
# Nothing in the Vercel deployment builds an image any more (the gateway container
# was retired by docs/decisions/0015-direct-service-routing.md). The file stays so
# a future image of the Go services — which needs the repository root as its
# context, because services/go.mod replaces the platform module with a relative
# path (../packages/go/platform) — never uploads node_modules, build output or
# secrets.
#
# Everything below is either unrelated to a Go build or must never enter an image.

.git
.github
.vercel
.wrangler
node_modules
.output
dist
coverage

# Secrets and local configuration: an image must never carry them.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Web app and the assets it builds from, plus material the Go images do not use.
src
public
docs
supabase
tests
scripts
packages/api-contracts
*.log
